Thu Oct 20 23:35:05 1994  John Salmon  <johns@mdwarf>

	* walk.c:  Added a slightly different mechanism for detecting
	deadlock.

	* msgdirinit.c: backed out of yesterday's changes.  Using mpmy
	leads to some kind of deadlock in Bcast.  I think bcast is non-
