Mon Oct  3 15:46:10 1994  Mike Warren  (msw@sampson)

	* libsw/Make.paragon (asmsrc): Add clear_tregs.s  The __mth_i_qidiv()
	in Paragon OSF/1 Rel. 1.0.4 Server 1.2 R1.2.3 is coded poorly and
	uniform_rand() will take 100x longer due FPE handling if there is
