Tue Aug 16 17:03:43 1994  Mike Warren  (msw@sampson)

	* libtree/tree.c (SetupTree): Assign tp->hash_mask.  It would make
	sense to make this Nparticles dependent at some stage.

	* include/tree.h (Find,NewCell): Make HASH_MASK a part of the tree_t
	structure.  Lesson: Don't use macro values in inlined functions.

	* libSDF/ This is libSDF2 from tree15.

	* libtree/nlcomm.c: Changes to NLDone to make it work for
	arbitrary machine sizes.

	* libsw/decomp_uniform.c: Some decomp functions that go along
	with pqsort.  These work great if your data is spread out,
	like a random distribution of particles.  However, it bombs
	completely if things are highly non-uniform, like a bunch
	of galaxies.  Stay tuned for a new improved decomp.c that works
	for anything.

	* libsw/gc.c: The topology is changed from the tree15 version.

	* libtree/pqsort.c: Complete rewrite. Works with any sized machine.

	* libsw/batch.c: Buffer lots of small sends into bigger sends.

	* libsw/poll.c: A generic implementation of waiting for a lot
	of asynchronous messages and finishing up nicely, without leaving
	a mess.

	* Begin tree16.  Smaller, Faster, Better.

